## 2. Data Collection

**Qarbad does not collect, transmit, or share any personal or sensitive data.**

All information you enter into this app — including but not limited to expense records, income records, account names, account balances, transaction descriptions, and any profile details (name, email, phone) — is stored **exclusively on your device** using local SQLite storage.

We do not:
- Collect any personal information
- Transmit any data to external servers
- Share any data with third parties
- Use any analytics or tracking SDKs
- Display third-party advertisements
- Access your location, contacts, camera, microphone, or any other device sensors
- Require an internet connection for normal operation

