## 4. Data Storage & Security

All data resides in a local SQLite database on your device. The app does not create any online accounts, does not sync to the cloud, and does not transmit any information over a network.

**Data deletion:** Uninstalling Qarbad removes all stored data from your device.

---

## 5. Children's Privacy

Qarbad does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13 (or the applicable age of consent in your jurisdiction). Since no data is collected at all, children can use the app safely without risk of data collection.

