## 6. Your Rights (GDPR, CCPA, and similar regulations)

Because Qarbad does not collect any personal data, there is no data to access, correct, delete, or port. You have full control over your data — all information you enter is under your control on your own device, and you can delete it at any time by editing or removing records within the app, or by uninstalling the application.

